        "THE QUANTUM-GRAVITY LENS'S RIDER IS DECIDED, NOT SKIPPED, AND IT CUTS BOTH WAYS: at both admissible witnesses all 16 healed-edge residues are nonzero but only 12 are DISTINCT and they span only DIMENSION 3, every one of the 120 edge pairs is classified, 116 commutators land OUTSIDE that span, the 4 identically-zero commutators are exactly the pairs ((t,0),(t,1)) whose two edges carry the IDENTICAL residue because the healing weights repeat a leading zero -- so ZERO pairs of distinct residues commute -- first-order closure is 6 and the generated Lie algebra is 30 at the cone witness against 56 at the TYPE B witness; THE CONSEQUENCE IS STATED CAREFULLY: the connection residues are NEITHER first-class, since the bracket leaves the span immediately, NOR inert, since the generated algebra is an order of magnitude larger than the generating set, so the Dirac pure-gauge reading of the connection's invisibility is NOT supported and the confinement of the connection to the dead-live coupling stands as a SELECTION-RULE fact with no constraint-algebra interpretation behind it -- at this fixture, these 16 residues, and a dimension that is itself carrier-dependent, which is a genuine defect in any structural reading of the rider",
